        <item>
            <title>1.0.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:51:33 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>LimitBar 1.0.0</h2>
<p>The first stable release of LimitBar.</p>
<ul>
<li>Choose which limit appears next to the menu bar icon: the lowest one or any specific window.</li>
<li>Claude Code or Codex are hidden when they are not installed on this Mac.</li>
<li>The pace indicator is gone: each limit shows only what is left and when it resets.</li>
<li>Automatic updates.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
